        <body>
            <div xml:id="d951">

                <pb facs="0753" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg677"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/8201</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Blocker to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eagle Pass, Tex</hi></placeName>., <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-17T13:00:00-06:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 17, 1916, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s November 6, 5 p.m. Called on Mexican authorities this morning and
                    impressed upon them the extreme necessity of <pb facs="0754" n="678"
                        xml:id="pg678"/> receiving definite information of Americans at Parral. In
                    interview a message was shown me from General Murguia dated Escalon advising his
                    capture that place after severe fighting on Tuesday and that fifteen hundred
                    Villistas defending the town had fallen back toward Jiminez. Authorities express
                    doubt that Murguia will be able to obtain definite information until the capture
                    of the town, but have sent urgent telegrams to him on the subject. I have also
                    telegraphed British Vice Consul at Torreon to do all possible and wire results
                    immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blocker</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
